{"v":4,"catch":"預備，準備，開始！","desc":"“MAGICAL SPEED”是ALLUMER於1994年發行的卡牌遊戲。主角NICOLE和CLAIRE為了尋找可以實現任何願望的“RAINBOW CARD”展開了一場偉大的冒險！ 先打出手上和場上的所有牌！連續出牌的話，惡魔會干擾敵人，是一款不一樣的“SPEED”遊戲！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-02-09","genres":["派對","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5ae939cdd3b01c0042478886038f62e46a4866f9276aeaf49fcdf5198fa45a99.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d57deb4db526aff1bb5b0b82bd627863e96ed4b23f4ffbb1e9551b293dd6c33.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53dac6d3fec5cc74e8d0f25ea04bd53422d8eee60f3828fbc18d9f15a427fb74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/617093ea27925b1feec113efcc966b1448f661675f25acdd94fd7169c7b3fd27.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/809d2078447c0342b6b11b804abf7a4b402332e18d55de025156871afe2c2cf7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c2fb2b8801c9ff718d26e6f563c2df796f21ca61f54dfae3c3c3c1508634f11.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a8801a19e000","dlc":[]}